Draugr      dev  (latest: v9.9.9. Run 'draugr self-update')

TOOLS
Tool         Status      Version  Notes
cosign       – optional  -        optional: draugr tools install cosign
git          ✗ missing   -        install: https://git-scm.com/downloads
gitleaks     ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install gitleaks
gosec        ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install gosec
govulncheck  ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install govulncheck, it is distributed as a Go package and needs a Go toolchain to build
grype        ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install grype
kube-bench   ✗ missing   -        install: https://github.com/aquasecurity/kube-bench/releases, extract both the binary and its cfg/ directory
kubectl      ✗ missing   -        install: https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/tools/
notation     ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install notation
nuclei       ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install nuclei
prowler      ✗ missing   -        install: Apache-2.0; install with `pip install prowler` (Python 3.10 to 3.13) or run the prowlercloud/prowler container image, which `draugr tools install` does not fetch. See internal/scanners/prowler.md
retire       ✗ missing   -        install: npm install -g retire, retire.js publishes to npm only, so it needs a Node runtime
semgrep      ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install semgrep
syft         ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install syft
trivy        ✗ missing   -        install: draugr tools install trivy

